cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite this AI-developed mathematical and formal proof collection as authored
  by Dev Goyal. See AI_DISCLOSURE.md for generation, attribution, and review status.
title: "Final OEIS collection: individual manuscripts and Lean proofs"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Goyal
    given-names: Dev
version: 5.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-24
abstract: >-
  Final consolidation of the completed OEIS work into 34 separate mathematical
  manuscripts, their editable LaTeX sources, and 34 named Lean proof interfaces.
  All original proof implementations and all 339 original audited endpoints
  are preserved. The collection includes proved source conjectures, known
  results with prior credit, standard consequences, and explicit corrections
  to false claims. ChatGPT generated the developments and consolidation in
  response to Dev Goyal's prompts, with upstream and historical contributions
  separately attributed. Independent human review is pending. No global
  novelty or publication acceptance is asserted.
keywords:
  - formal power series
  - integer sequences
  - congruences
  - Lean
  - formal verification
  - artificial intelligence
